# ── PolyGlot Live AI — environment variables ─────────────────────────────────
# End users supply their OWN Gemini / Groq / OpenAI API keys at runtime through
# the in-app Settings modal. Those keys live ONLY in the browser's
# localStorage and are used for direct client-side calls to each provider —
# they are never sent to, logged by, or stored on this server.
#
# The variables below are OPTIONAL and only matter if you choose to enable
# the server-side fallback routes (src/app/api/translate, src/app/api/tts),
# e.g. to sidestep a provider's CORS policy or to offer a "no key needed" demo
# mode on your own Vercel deployment. Leave them unset otherwise.

# GEMINI_API_KEY=
# GROQ_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
